// Combat arena: a small walled room with the player at one end and a knight
// at the other, and nowhere for either to go.
//
// Deliberately tiny. testbed_knight.ron gives the knight a 400px route, which
// is right for testing patrol and wrong for testing a fight: a combat tape
// that has to chase a walking target across a ledge encodes the walk speed,
// the run speed, and the knockback distance all at once, and breaks if any of
// them is tuned. Here the knight is always within a couple of strides.
//
// Fixture map — do not move anything already here; tapes encode its pixels.
//
//   room    x 32..288, floor top y=128
//   spawn   col 2, row 3   world (70, 94)
//   knight  col 7, row 3   world (229, 98)
Level(
    tileset: "castle",
    grid: [
        "##########",
        "#........#",
        "#........#",
        "#.P....K.#",
        "##########",
        "##########",
    ],
    entities: [],
)
